      "note": "Reviewed both successful BSC campaign receipts, the first transaction call trace, the pinned DeFiHackLabs reproduction, the GDS creation receipt, and historical runtime code. The first transaction at 24449918:41 already exercises the defect while distributing pair tokens among 100 helpers; the second transaction at 24451036:75 completes their redemption. GDS was created directly at 23608262:87 by 0x5b18b1d988479526267a1aa0d66765cc7c3cc3a8, code was absent one block earlier, and runtime hash 0x7a5a2cbe...99d9 is identical at deployment and immediately before exploitation. Transfer logs show a net 3,600 USDT entering pair 0x4526c263571eb57110d161b41df8fd073df3c44a in the setup transaction and a net 40,852.750053127377203615 USDT leaving it in the completion transaction, for exact gross victim depletion of 37,252.750053127377203615 USDT after excluding the attacker's input."
